This repository holds the data and assets behind the Collection-Bound tracker,
the Riftbound Starter Handbook and the Lore Codex on unravelingtherift.com.

WHAT IS COVERED
The following are the original work of Unraveling the Rift and are NOT licensed
for reuse:
  - the selection, arrangement and compilation of the card, product, promo and
    regional-variant data in this repository (including ogn.json, ogs.json,
    sfd.json, unl.json, ven.json, products.json, cardtext.json and the files in
    codex/ and handbook/), including the research identifying regional
    printings, sealed products and image sources;
  - original writing, guides, layouts and code;
  - original photographs and scans, logos and branding.

No permission is granted to copy, scrape, mirror, republish, redistribute,
sell, or use any of the above to build or populate another website, app,
database or dataset, in whole or in part, without written permission.
Files are public on GitHub only so the unravelingtherift.com website can load
them; being publicly reachable does not grant a license.

